18
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,400
When discovery follows a defined

19
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:34,310
structure, the data in the CRM reflects

20
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:34,840
reality.

21
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:37,340
When handoffs between teams follow a

22
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:39,200
