35
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:01,550
Build the process first.

36
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:04,060
Then let AI enforce and optimize it.

37
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:06,710
Follow A-Gent for the agent-first GTM

